@@ -0,0 +1,77 @@
+/*
+ * Written by Wilco Dijkstra, 1996. The following email exchange establishes the
+ * license.
+ *
+ * From: Wilco Dijkstra <Wilco.Dijkstra@ntlworld.com>
+ * Date: Fri, Jun 24, 2011 at 3:20 AM
